# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The credits roll (582 px, 19 px, centred, wraps). Translate the role headings and the sentences; names, companies, tools, licences, works' titles and the address stay as written. The translation credit (decision D2) is added in each language's own text under AI-ASSISTED PRODUCTION, so the English keeps none.
#. i18n: speaker=ui
#: scenes/main.tscn
msgid ""
"[center][color=#73DDF5]ORIGINAL CONCEPT, CORE STORY & CREATIVE VISION[/color]\n"
"[font_size=30][b]Nathanial Henniges[/b][/font_size]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]DEVELOPMENT[/color]\n"
"[font_size=26][b]MrDemonWolf, Inc.[/b][/font_size]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]AI-ASSISTED PRODUCTION[/color]\n"
"ChatGPT and Codex (OpenAI) and Claude Code by Anthropic\n"
"assisted with research, writing and code.\n"
"Nathanial directed and reviewed the work.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]PROVISIONAL ART[/color]\n"
"Created with ChatGPT Create and the Codex image generation tool.\n"
"The characters, station props, rooms and doors are whole\n"
"pieces painted over script-drawn shape guides (October 16, 2026).\n"
"Nathanial reviewed and approved each set.\n"
"The WOLF OVERRIDE mark was redrawn from a generated concept.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]SOUND EFFECTS[/color]\n"
"Most are generated by the game's own code.\n"
"\n"
"Recorded steam (CC0)\n"
"Joseph Sardin - BigSoundBank.com / LaSonotheque.org\n"
"\n"
"Recorded growls (CC0, OpenGameArt.org)\n"
"pauliuw, bonebrah and AntumDeluge\n"
"(bear growl from the U.S. Fish & Wildlife Service)\n"
"\n"
"No music or voice yet.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]TYPEFACES[/color]\n"
"Roboto and Montserrat\n"
"SIL Open Font License 1.1\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]BUILT WITH[/color]\n"
"Godot 4.7.2  /  GDScript\n"
"Next.js  /  Fumadocs  /  Tailwind CSS  /  Bun\n"
"Pillow  /  NumPy  /  SciPy  /  ImageMagick  /  cwebp\n"
"Playwright\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]RESEARCH & CRAFT REFERENCES[/color]\n"
"Fumito Ueda / The Last Guardian\n"
"Companion behavior and visual storytelling\n"
"\n"
"Naughty Dog / The Last of Us Part II\n"
"Reviewed controls and readable presentation\n"
"\n"
"Game Accessibility Guidelines\n"
"Player-paced text and recognizable interactions\n"
"\n"
"Godot 4.7 Camera2D reference\n"
"Camera follow and smoothing\n"
"\n"
"Nielsen Norman Group\n"
"Mobile screenshot readability\n"
"\n"
"NIST AI Risk Management Framework\n"
"National Archives records guidance\n"
"\n"
"Real door hardware and safety standards (October 2026)\n"
"Shapes, sizes and colours of the doors\n"
"\n"
"How it should play: about 400 sources (October 2026)\n"
"Valve, Playdead, Naughty Dog, Nintendo and others\n"
"Pacing, controls, the companion and playtesting\n"
"\n"
"References inform craft, not the origin of this game.\n"
"Original concept, core story and creative vision:\n"
"Nathanial Henniges.\n"
"Referenced creators are not project contributors.\n"
"\n"
"Full sources, tools and asset credits:\n"
"wolfoverride.mrdemonwolf.dev/docs/credits/\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=24][b]THANK YOU FOR PLAYING[/b][/font_size][/center]"
msgstr ""
"[center][color=#73DDF5]CONCEPTO ORIGINAL, HISTORIA PRINCIPAL Y VISIÓN CREATIVA[/color]\n"
"[font_size=30][b]Nathanial Henniges[/b][/font_size]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]DESARROLLO[/color]\n"
"[font_size=26][b]MrDemonWolf, Inc.[/b][/font_size]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]PRODUCCIÓN ASISTIDA POR IA[/color]\n"
"ChatGPT y Codex (OpenAI) y Claude Code de Anthropic\n"
"ayudaron con la investigación, la redacción y el código.\n"
"Nathanial dirigió y revisó el trabajo.\n"
"Español: traducción automática de Claude (Anthropic), verificada con Codex (OpenAI). Aún sin revisión nativa.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]ARTE PROVISIONAL[/color]\n"
"Creado con ChatGPT Create y la herramienta de imágenes de Codex.\n"
"Los personajes, los objetos de las estaciones, las salas y las puertas son piezas enteras pintadas sobre guías de formas dibujadas por código (16 de octubre de 2026).\n"
"Nathanial revisó y aprobó cada conjunto.\n"
"La marca WOLF OVERRIDE se redibujó a partir de un concepto generado.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]EFECTOS DE SONIDO[/color]\n"
"La mayoría los genera el propio código del juego.\n"
"\n"
"Vapor grabado (CC0)\n"
"Joseph Sardin - BigSoundBank.com / LaSonotheque.org\n"
"\n"
"Gruñidos grabados (CC0, OpenGameArt.org)\n"
"pauliuw, bonebrah y AntumDeluge\n"
"(gruñido de oso del U.S. Fish & Wildlife Service)\n"
"\n"
"Aún no hay música ni voces.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]TIPOGRAFÍAS[/color]\n"
"Roboto y Montserrat\n"
"SIL Open Font License 1.1\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]HECHO CON[/color]\n"
"Godot 4.7.2  /  GDScript\n"
"Next.js  /  Fumadocs  /  Tailwind CSS  /  Bun\n"
"Pillow  /  NumPy  /  SciPy  /  ImageMagick  /  cwebp\n"
"Playwright\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[color=#73DDF5]REFERENCIAS DE INVESTIGACIÓN Y OFICIO[/color]\n"
"Fumito Ueda / The Last Guardian\n"
"Comportamiento del compañero y narrativa visual\n"
"\n"
"Naughty Dog / The Last of Us Part II\n"
"Controles revisados y presentación legible\n"
"\n"
"Game Accessibility Guidelines\n"
"Texto al ritmo de quien juega e interacciones reconocibles\n"
"\n"
"Referencia de Camera2D de Godot 4.7\n"
"Seguimiento y suavizado de la cámara\n"
"\n"
"Nielsen Norman Group\n"
"Legibilidad de capturas de pantalla en móviles\n"
"\n"
"NIST AI Risk Management Framework\n"
"Guía de registros de los National Archives\n"
"\n"
"Herrajes de puertas y normas de seguridad reales (octubre de 2026)\n"
"Formas, tamaños y colores de las puertas\n"
"\n"
"Cómo debería jugarse: unas 400 fuentes (octubre de 2026)\n"
"Valve, Playdead, Naughty Dog, Nintendo y otros\n"
"Ritmo, controles, el compañero y las pruebas de juego\n"
"\n"
"Las referencias orientan el oficio, no el origen de este juego.\n"
"Concepto original, historia principal y visión creativa:\n"
"Nathanial Henniges.\n"
"Los creadores citados no colaboran en el proyecto.\n"
"\n"
"Fuentes completas, herramientas y créditos de recursos:\n"
"wolfoverride.mrdemonwolf.dev/docs/credits/\n"
"\n"
"\n"
